---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Books | Ayush Prakash"
  description="Books by Ayush Prakash: AI for Gen Z, The Transcendence of Technology, and Being Human, a work in progress on technology and society."
>
  <div class="feature">
    <p class="kicker">Out Now</p>
    <h1 class="dtitle">AI for Gen Z</h1>
    <p class="lede">How artificial intelligence lands on the first generation that will never know life without it.</p>
    <div class="cover"><img src="/img/book-genz.jpg" alt="AI for Gen Z book cover" /></div>
    <div class="pillrow"><a class="pill" href="https://www.amazon.com/dp/0981182135" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Buy the book</a></div>
  </div>
  <hr class="rule" />
  <div class="feature" id="transcendence-of-technology">
    <p class="kicker">Upcoming</p>
    <h2 class="dtitle technology-title"><span>The Transcendence</span><span>of Technology</span></h2>
    <p class="dsub">A Spiritual Return for Humanity</p>
    <p class="lede">Technology augments. A rock augments strength, a fishing rod augments a catch, a computer augments what a mind can hold. It was never the answer. This book is about what happened when we started treating an external tool as a solution to an internal problem, and what a return would look like.</p>
    <div class="cover"><img src="/img/book-technology.jpg" alt="The Transcendence of Technology book cover" /></div>
    {/* TODO: add pre-order link when the publisher provides one */}
  </div>
  <hr class="rule" />
  <section class="feature being-human" id="being-human">
    <p class="kicker">In Progress</p>
    <h2 class="dtitle">Being Human</h2>
    <p class="dsub">Short Stories, Poems, and Essays on Technology and Society</p>
  </section>
  <style>
    .feature .technology-title { max-width: none; }
    .technology-title span { display: block; }
    .being-human .dtitle { max-width: none; }
    .being-human .dsub { max-width: 30ch; margin: clamp(26px, 4vw, 48px) auto 0; }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
